# (Canonical.FormatVersion 4 -> 5, AgentState.Suppression added). The spike
# fixture is enemy-free, so Suppression stays 0 at every checkpoint: the 24
# ticks and 75 domain events are unchanged, a byte-layout-only re-pin.
